<title>USA: Intersystems plastic plant to add to Q4.</title>
<headline>Intersystems plastic plant to add to Q4.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>InterSystems Inc said its plastics compounding plant, managed by its subsidiary, Chemtrusion Inc, last week became fully operational and will begin to contribute material earnings in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The plant is operating four production lines and is expected to produce 35 million pounds of product annually. Plans also include additional space and equipment to accommodate future expansions.</p>
<p>Chemtrusion is operating the plant for Mytex Polymers, a joint venture of Mitsubishi Chemical Corp and Exxon Chemical, a unit fo Exxon Corp.</p>
</text>
